---
import LegalLayout from '../components/LegalLayout.astro';
import { firm } from '../data/site';

const toc = [
  { text: 'Attorney advertising', slug: 'attorney-advertising' },
  { text: 'General information only', slug: 'general-information-only' },
  { text: 'No guarantee of results', slug: 'no-guarantee-of-results' },
  { text: 'Case results and dockets', slug: 'case-results-and-dockets' },
  { text: 'Jurisdiction and licensing', slug: 'jurisdiction-and-licensing' },
  { text: 'Deadlines and reliance', slug: 'deadlines-and-reliance' },
  { text: 'Third-party information', slug: 'third-party-information' },
  { text: 'Language and translation', slug: 'language-and-translation' },
  { text: 'Contact', slug: 'contact' },
];
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Disclaimer | Sulfab Law Office P.C."
  description="Important limitations on the information published by Sulfab Law Office P.C., including attorney advertising, prior results, and jurisdictional scope."
  h1="Disclaimer"
  eyebrow="Important Notice"
  lede="What this website does and does not tell you, and the limits that apply to the information published here."
  updated="2026-11-21"
  toc={toc}
>
  <p>
    This page explains the limits of the information published on
    <a href="https://www.sulfablaw.com">sulfablaw.com</a> by Sulfab Law Office P.C. Please read it
    together with our <a href="/terms-of-service">Terms of Service</a> and
    <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2 id="attorney-advertising">Attorney advertising</h2>
  <p>
    This website is attorney advertising. It is intended to provide general information about the
    firm and the immigration services it offers, and to allow people to contact the firm. It is not
    a solicitation of clients in any jurisdiction where the firm is not licensed to practice, and it
    is not directed to anyone in a state where the content would violate that state’s rules.
  </p>
  <p>
    The firm is licensed in the State of California. Its attorneys are admitted in the courts listed
    on the <a href="/about-us">About page</a>. Admission in one jurisdiction does not authorize
    practice in another, and federal immigration practice is subject to specific rules.
  </p>

  <h2 id="general-information-only">General information only</h2>
  <p>
    The content on this website — including practice-area pages, service-area pages, FAQs, guides,
    and answers to common questions — is general information, not legal advice. It does not take
    into account your particular facts, history, deadlines, or relief options. Immigration law and
    agency policy change frequently, and information that was accurate when written may later be
    outdated.
  </p>
  <p>
    You should not act, or decide not to act, based on this website alone. A short consultation with
    an attorney who can review your documents is the only reliable way to understand your options.
  </p>

  <h2 id="no-guarantee-of-results">No guarantee of results</h2>
  <p>
    Nothing on this website promises or guarantees any outcome. Descriptions of how the firm
    approaches a type of case, or of relief that may be available in the abstract, are not
    predictions about your matter. Every case depends on its facts, the evidence, the court, the
    agency, and the law in effect at the time.
  </p>

  <h2 id="case-results-and-dockets">Case results and dockets</h2>
  <p>
    Where the website describes federal court filings or decisions, those descriptions are drawn
    from public dockets and are provided to illustrate the firm’s experience. Prior results do not
    guarantee or predict a similar outcome in any other case. Docket information can be updated,
    corrected, or sealed, and the firm does not warrant that every entry is current. Clients and
    prospective clients should confirm the status of a matter directly with the court or with the
    firm.
  </p>

  <h2 id="jurisdiction-and-licensing">Jurisdiction and licensing</h2>
  <p>
    The firm’s attorneys are licensed to practice law in California and before specified federal
    courts. The firm does not claim licensure in any other state. If your matter requires
    representation in another jurisdiction, the firm will tell you and may refer you to counsel
    there. Nothing on this website should be read as an offer to practice law where the firm is not
    authorized to do so.
  </p>

  <h2 id="deadlines-and-reliance">Deadlines and reliance</h2>
  <p>
    Immigration deadlines can be short and unforgiving. The website does not calculate deadlines,
    extend them, or preserve them. If you have a Notice to Appear, a hearing date, a filing
    deadline, or a family member in custody, contact the firm directly at
    <a href={firm.phoneHref}>{firm.phoneDisplay}</a>. Do not rely on a web form or on general
    website content to protect a deadline.
  </p>

  <h2 id="third-party-information">Third-party information</h2>
  <p>
    This website links to government agencies, courts, review platforms, map services, and other
    third-party sites. The firm does not control those sites and is not responsible for their
    content, accuracy, availability, or privacy practices. A link does not constitute an endorsement
    or a verification of the information found there.
  </p>
  <p>
    Client reviews and profile ratings displayed or linked from this site are the statements of
    third parties. They are not verified by the firm, and they are not a promise about your case.
  </p>

  <h2 id="language-and-translation">Language and translation</h2>
  <p>
    Some content or communications may be available in Spanish or other languages. Translations are
    provided as a convenience. If there is any conflict between an English version and a translation,
    the English version controls. Interpreters and translated documents used in a case must meet the
    requirements of the relevant court or agency.
  </p>

  <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about this disclaimer can be sent to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Sulfab Law Office P.C.</strong></li>
    <li>{firm.address.street}, {firm.address.city}, {firm.address.state} {firm.address.zip}</li>
    <li>Email: <a href={firm.emailHref}>{firm.email}</a></li>
    <li>Telephone: <a href={firm.phoneHref}>{firm.phoneDisplay}</a></li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    This disclaimer is general and should be reviewed by the firm’s counsel to confirm it matches the
    firm’s advertising and website practices.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
